  "body": "After I upgrade synapse, I find I can no longer login with oidc. It jumps to <my_homeserver>/_matrix/client/r0/login/sso/redirect?redirectUrl=<my_web/element>, then 302 to itself agina and agin.\r\n\r\nI have rewritten the `oidc_providers` part as the https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/docs/openid.md says (it used to be `oidc_config`), but this problem still happened. \r\nIt even never jump to issuer url so I think this problem is not related to the list of permitted \"redirect URIs\" at the identity provider.(v1.27.0)\r\n\r\nCan anyone give me some hints? Is there any other breaking change related to oidc?",
